It stars Tom Hanks, Matthew Rhys, Susan Kelechi Watson, and Chris Cooper.

14
01:09:21,818 --> 01:09:27,818
It depicts Lloyd Vogel (Rhys), a troubled journalist for Esquire who is
assigned to profile television icon Fred Rogers (Hanks).

15
01:14:19,090 --> 01:14:25,090
The film premiered at the Toronto International Film Festival on September 7, 2019, and was
theatrically released in the United States on November 22, 2019, by Sony Pictures Releasing.

16
