It grossed $68 million worldwide.

17
01:24:13,636 --> 01:24:19,636
Critics praised Hanks and Rhys's performances, Heller's
direction, and its heart-warming messages.

18
01:29:10,909 --> 01:29:16,909
It was chosen by Time magazine as one of the ten best films of the year.

19
